379	     * {@code namesakeCount} is 0; add 2 for a household of 3 or more members (see
380	     * {@link #setHouseholdSize(Integer)}); add 3 for a tenure of at least one elapsed fiscal year, i.e.
381	     * the {@code registrationDate} falls in an earlier {@link #fiscalYear(LocalDate) fiscal year} than
382	     * today (fiscal years start 1 July). A newly created owner has zero tenure, so a fresh owner scores
383	     * at most 5 points (2 + 1 + 2).
