481	     * ({@code Sydney->NSW}, {@code Melbourne->VIC}, {@code Brisbane->QLD}), or {@code "UNKNOWN"} when the
482	     * city is not in the table. The single source of truth for the create-time postcode range check in
483	     * {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.function.owner.ValidateOwnerPostcode}.
