491	     * VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099), or {@code null} when the region has no band. This is the single
492	     * source of truth for the bands, shared by {@link #regionOfPostcode(String) the postcode-to-region
493	     * lookup} (which feeds the customerCode's region, and hence the locality) and the create-time
494	     * postcode range check.
